            'step 1: check_slot\nstep 2: check_slot\nstopped after 2 steps with: no answer': 'The limit is three, so three decisions are read before the loop ends.',
            'stopped after 0 steps with: no answer': 'step starts at 0 and 0 < 3, so the loop does run.',
